      "english": "The Exterior as Suffering in the Three Times "
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "“Rūpā, bhikkhave, dukkhā atītānāgatā; ",
      "english": "“Mendicants, sights of the past and future are suffering, "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "ko pana vādo paccuppannānaṁ. ",
      "english": "let alone the present. …” "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "Evaṁ passaṁ, bhikkhave, sutavā ariyasāvako atītesu rūpesu anapekkho hoti; ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "anāgate rūpe nābhinandati; paccuppannānaṁ rūpānaṁ nibbidāya virāgāya nirodhāya paṭipanno hotī”ti …pe…. ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "pali": "Ekādasamaṁ. ",
      "english": ""
    }
